@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - BPO Management System Search

[*] --> FilterSelection

state "FilterSelection" as FS {
    [*] --> CategoryFilter : [Select filter category]
    [*] --> PriceRangeFilter : [Select price range]

    state "CategoryFilter" as CF
    state "PriceRangeFilter" as PRF

    CF --> MatchingUsers : [Search based on category]
    PRF --> MatchingUsers : [Search based on price range]

    state "MatchingUsers" as MU
    MU --> [*] : [Display matching users]
}

FilterSelection : entry / Search by filter
FilterSelection : do / Select filter criteria
FilterSelection : exit / After selection

@enduml
